e revised value for older months where a later release shows it.^Values are in current US dollars, so rupee depreciation or commodity prices change them without any change in volumes. Figures here are goods only; services trade is on a separate page."}],"related":[],"layer":"added","note":"The latest month is a quick estimate and is revised when final data come in about a month later; earlier months on this page use the revised figure published in the next year's release.","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T07:29:00+00:00"}